  dialogue:
  - type: 0
    dialogueText: 'Perfect! You can see the budget went down in the UI on the left.
      Remember to keep an eye on that or you''ll fall into debt. Also keep an eye
      out for when money gets siphoned from the accounts.  '
  - type: 0
    dialogueText: 'The the medicine count will increase later, after the Nurse has
      unpacked and organised it on the shelves.

      Lets move on to the Nurse
      next!'
  - type: 1
    dialogueText: Click "P" to switch to the Nurse
